Package: slate
Title: Sparse Latent Factor Model for Annotated Genomics and Time-to-Event Data
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-10-27
Authors@R: c( 
    person("Dan", "Schaid", role = c("aut")),
    person("Jason", "Sinnwell", email="sinnwell.jason@mayo.edu",role=c("aut", "cre"))
  ) 
Description: A sparse latent factor model for multivariate features (e.g., proteomics, expression) and time-to-event outcomes using a penalized approach. A grid search of the penalty parameters can be incorporated to find the best model. 
Imports: MASS, statmod, survival, stats
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
